fin-orders:OrderIntentShape a sh:NodeShape;
    sh:description "Stable trade intent issued by a client, strategy, or authorized routing process. Its logical identity is the authority-scoped intent identifier, and its version fixes account, instrument, optional listing or OTC context, side, positive absolute quantity, order type, validity, price conditions, and source evidence before provider acceptance. A routing-derived intent remains distinct from its source intents and is connected only through an immutable OrderIntentLineage fact.";
    sh:name "Order Intent";
